--TEST--
a cursor on an `array<mixed>` annotation whose literal has a `mixed` element is offered nothing, because `mixed` is already the narrowest type the literal gives, `rule:ide/the-action-answers-from-the-literal-or-not-at-all`
--FILE--
<?nvs
mixed $any = 1;
array<mi<|>xed> $cells = [1, $any];
--REQUEST--
codeAction
--EXPECT--
none
